+(The 1.2x rows are in the file.) Clause 1: 0.998–0.999 at 2x, over 0.95.
+Clause 2: false denies at 0.8x 0.001–0.002 against 0.111–0.156, 70x and
+more under. Clause 3 asserted, never tripped. Clause 4: velocity error by
+window (1, 5, 15, 30, 60 s) 0.2138, 0.0567, 0.0513, 0.0436, 0.0240 →
+0.2137, 0.0566, 0.0511, 0.0434, 0.0237 (mean 0.0779 → 0.0777; the base is
+the scorecard's 0.0779, so the harness is the filter's), none above the
+base; the sparse shape 0.0460 → 0.0141 (every window at least 2.3x lower),
